! -- abstract --
! I Joshua Cates of Christian County and Commonwealth of Kentucky do Constitute and appoint Col. Young Ewing of the County and state aforesaid my true and lawfull attorney for me and in my name to relinquish a Christian County Court Certificate Granted by said Court to Jacob McFadin at their May County court 1801 No 56 and assigned to me the 10'th of August 1810 by said Jacob McFadin in the Registers office of this state, and to do all lawfull acts request for affecting the Relinquishment of the Certificate aforesaid hereby ratifying and Confirming all that Col. Young Ewing my said attorney shall do or Cause to be done by virtue hereof In witness whereof have hereunto set my hand and affixed my seal this 30'th of October 1810 - DB-C:87[088]
