! -- abstract --
! Survey for John Dandridge 1500 Acres of land on part of a Military Warrant No 77 on the Waters of Cumberland River beginning at a White oak two Dogwoods a Hickory, and Red oak on the dividing line between the Continental and State troops 800 poles from the River and corner to James Pendletons Survey No. 33 Running with the dividing line East 343p ...  For Value received I assign all my right +c of the within land to Robert C. Harrison and request the Register to make a deed in his name - George C. Harrison - Test. George Madison Jason Isbell Jr - The within land has not bee redeemed George Madison - Dec 19 1808 ...
