! -- Warrant abstract --
! I do sell and Convey unto William Johnson all my Right + title to a certain tract of land Containing 400 Acres which was granted to Joshuay Stephens by Certifficate N 2373 by the County Court of Christian County and the plat and certificate assigned to me by S'd Stephens the said plat and certificate being now in the Registers office at frankfort + I hereby Request the Request [del]the Request[/del] to Issue the grant to S'd William Johnson but it is expressly agreed And this assignment is made upon the Expressed condition that I am not in any manner to be answerable for the Title of S'd land given under my hand this 13th day of June 1808 - DB-A:[424]
